@startuml ecs_after_summary
' 요약판 — ECS 적용 후 (refactor/simulate-view). 상세판: ecs_after.puml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #546E7A
skinparam ArrowColor #2E7D32
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #FFB300
}

title <size:20><b>적용 후</b></size>  ServerLoop.Tick 한 곳에 순서가 그대로

start
note right
  <color:#1565C0><b>역할 판단은 등록할 때 한 번</b></color>
  Authoring: <color:#1565C0>if (!IsServer) return</color> → Register(this)
  통과한 엔티티만 World 목록에 들어간다
end note
:0  EquipSystem;
:1  ServerPlayerSystem   → Projectiles;
:2  ProjectileSystem   → Hits;
:<b>3  DamageSystem</b>   <color:#C62828>①</color>; <<#FFEBEE>>
:4  EnemySystem;
:<b>5  DeathSystem</b>   <color:#C62828>②</color>   → Rewards · Despawns; <<#FFEBEE>>
:<b>6  SessionSystem</b>   <color:#C62828>③④</color>   → Level; <<#FFEBEE>>
:<b>7  StatSystem</b>   <color:#C62828>⑤</color>   → 최대 체력; <<#FFEBEE>>
:8  RewindSystem;
:9  SnapshotSystem;
:10  NetSendSystem;
:<b>11  DespawnSystem</b>   <color:#C62828>Despawn</color>; <<#FFEBEE>>
note right
  <color:#2E7D32><b>System 22개 (위 서버 12 + 클라 10)</b></color>
  <color:#2E7D32><b>모두 IsOwner · IsServer 0건</b></color>
  등록된 목록만 순회한다
  <color:#C62828>①~⑤</color> = 적용 전 이벤트 연쇄가 옮겨 간 단계
end note
stop
@enduml
